  "notes": "Official cause_code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields despite narrative giving substantial root-cause detail (relay malfunction, valve construction defect, and an over-reliance-on-risk-mitigation human factor); category left as 'provisional' per rule 4. Modeled two independent failure origins (relay malfunction and valve construction defect) each CAUSED_BY the same provisional cause node, converging on the air in-leakage failure mode. No stated operable backup system prevented the trip (AFWS/RPS actuated as a result of the trip, not as backups preventing it), so no BACKED_UP_BY edges emitted. 'No similar events in past three years' explicitly stated, so no SIMILAR_TO stub LER created."
